{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40627","headline":"避地冬夜与二三禅侣吟集茅斋 · 李洞","name":"避地冬夜与二三禅侣吟集茅斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四海通禅客，搜吟会草亭。\n捻髭孤烛白，闭目衆山青。\n松挂敲冰杖，罏温注月缾。\n独愁悬旧斾，笏冷立残星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}